ion, not user-facing in the traditional sense, but it's in the settings page. The version mismatch (title says v8.8, settings says v8.6) is a separate issue.\n\nOK, let me now make all the changes. Here's what I need to do:\n\n1. Create a theme name mapping and use it in the notification messages (lines 2304 and 2795)\n2. Change the keyboard shortcuts help text from English page names to Chinese (lines 2613-2621)\n\nLet me also double-check: are there any other English words in user-visible text?\n\nLet me search for common patterns...\n\nLooking at the code again, I see:\n- Line 1719: `从模板创建一个新的 Agent` - Chinese ✓\n- Line 1725: `Agent 名称 (可选)` - keep Agent ✓\n- Line 1727: `留空使用模板名称` - Chinese ✓\n- Line 1737: `选择模板` - Chinese ✓\n\nActually, I realize I should also look at the shortcut panel (lines 1003-1023) more carefully:\n- The keyboard shortcut keys are shown in English (1-5, R, H, ESC) but these are key names, not translatable text\n- The descriptions are all Chinese ✓\n\nI think I found everything. Let me now make the edits.\n\nWait, one more thing - let me check if there are any English strings in the stat cards that I might have missed:\n\nLines 1082-1098:\n- `总 Agents` ✓\n- `运行中` ✓\n- `总任务数` ✓\n- `已完成` ✓\n\nAnd the long task card:\n- `长期任务` ✓\n- `进行中` ✓\n- `加载中...` ✓\n- `输入长期任务内容...` ✓\n- `保存` ✓\n- `取消` ✓\n- `编辑` ✓\n\nUsage stats:\n- `用量统计` ✓\n- `每5分钟刷新` ✓\n- `加载中...` ✓\n\nCharts:\n- `Agent 状态分布` ✓\n- `任务完成进度` ✓\n- `总计` ✓ (in SVG)\n- `暂无数据` ✓\n\nProgress bars:\n- `暂无数据` ✓\n\nPerformance cards:\n- `CPU 使用率` ✓\n- `内存使用` ✓\n- `响应时间` ✓\n- `Token 消耗` ✓\n- `本月累计` ✓\n- `Token 消耗趋势（最近7天）` ✓\n- `近7天数据收集中` ✓\n- `性能建议` ✓\n- `启用 Agent 缓存` ✓\n- `自动优化` ✓\n\nOK, I think I've been thorough enough. The changes needed are:\n\n1. Theme names in notifications (lines 2304, 2795) - need Chinese mapping\n2. Keyboard help page names (lines 2613-2621) - need Chinese names\n\nActually, let me look one more time... I want to make sure I haven't missed anything in the file. Let me sea