博朋克' };\n```\n\nAnd use it in:\n- Line 2304: `showNotification(\\`主题已切换: ${newTheme}\\`, 'success');` → `showNotification(\\`主题已切换为${themeNames[newTheme] || newTheme}\\`, 'success');`\n- Line 2795: ``showNotification(`已切换到 ${themes[currentThemeIndex]} 主题`, 'success');`` → ``showNotification(`已切换到 ${themeNames[themes[currentThemeIndex]] || themes[currentThemeIndex]} 主题`, 'success');``\n\nActually wait, I also need to look at the `cycleTheme` function and the `applyTheme` function to see if theme names are used elsewhere.\n\nLet me re-read:\n```javascript\nfunction cycleTheme() {\n  currentThemeIndex = (currentThemeIndex + 1) % themes.length;\n  applyTheme(themes[currentThemeIndex]);\n}\n```\n\n```javascript\nfunction applyTheme(theme) {\n  if (theme === 'dark') {\n    document.documentElement.removeAttribute('data-theme');\n  } else {\n    document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n  }\n  localStorage.setItem('webui_theme', theme);\n  updateThemeIcon(theme);\n}\n```\n\nAnd the theme selector:\n```javascript\nthemeSelector.addEventListener('change', (e) => {\n  const newTheme = e.target.value;\n  ...\n  showNotification(`主题已切换: ${newTheme}`, 'success');\n});\n```\n\nSo line 2304 uses the raw theme value (dark/light/cyberpunk) in the notification. And line 2795:\n```javascript\ndocument.getElementById('theme-toggle')?.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  cycleTheme();\n  showNotification(`已切换到 ${themes[currentThemeIndex]} 主题`, 'success');\n});\n```\n\nOK, let me make these changes. I'll add a `themeNames` object near the `themes` array and use it in both places.\n\nLet me also check: is there any other place where English text appears that I should change?\n\nLooking at the status badge rendering:\n```javascript\n<span>${agent.status === 'disabled' ? '已禁用' : agent.status === 'idle' ? '空闲' : agent.status === 'active' ? '运行中' : agent.status}</span>\n```\nThis is already Chinese ✓\n\nLooking at the task status badge:\n```javascript\n<span class=\"status-badge ${task.status}\">${task.status}</span>\n```\nWait, this shows the raw status value (pending/done). Should these be translated? The task says to translate user-visible text. Let me check... the task statuses come from the API, so \"pending\" and \"done\" would be shown. These should be translated.\n\nActually, the task description says \"保持代码中的变量名、CSS类名、API路径不变，只改用户可见的显示文本\". So I should translate the displayed status text but keep the CSS class name.\n\nSo line 2129:\n```javascript\n<td><span class=\"status-badge ${task.status}\">${task.status}</span></td>\n```\nShould become something like:\n```javascript\n<td><span class=\"status-badge ${task.status}\">${task.status === 'done' ? '已完成' : task.status === 'pending' ? '待处理' : task.status}</span></td>\n```\n\nOK let me also check the donut chart legend labels. Line 2089:\n```javascript\nconst statusData = Object.entries(statusCounts).map(([status, count]) => ({\n  label: status,\n  value: count\n}));\n```\nThe status values (running, idle, disabled) are used as labels in the chart. These should be translated too.\n\nLet me fix this as well.\n\nOK, now I have a complete list of changes to make. Let me implement them all:\n\n1. Add theme name mapping\n2. Fix keyboard help page names\n3. Fix theme notification messages\n4. Fix task status display\n5. Fix donut chart status labels\n6. Fix model \"tokens\" display in usage stats\n\nLet me start making the edits.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d64e1a9d-08e5-4edf-9a30-2c526c5dbaf6","uuid":"ce72c7f9-76c8-4ae7-949d-f86284651fb8"}
